 "source": "<!-- Whitespace is significant. xml:space is a no-op under the default strict\n     setting; it is here so the later package cannot pretend otherwise. -->\n<root>\n  <keep xml:space=\"preserve\" note=\"author spacing is significant\">  a   b  </keep>\n  <norm note=\"also preserved at default\">  a   b  </norm>\n  <!-- mixed content whose spaces are the document -->\n  <p> one <em> two </em> three </p>\n  <pre>\nline one\n  indented line\n</pre>\n  <!-- blank-line runs in strict mode are CharData, not layout -->\n  <blank>\n\n\n<child/>\n\n  </blank>\n</root>\n",
